### Create request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/application-requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Moje żądanie",
  "body": "Treść żądania"
}

### List requests
GET http://localhost:8080/api/application-requests?page=1&size=10

### Get request by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/application-requests/{{requestId}}

### Update request body
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/application-requests/{{requestId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "body": "Zaktualizowana treść"
}

### Verify request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/application-requests/{{requestId}}/verify

### Accept request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/application-requests/{{requestId}}/accept

### Reject request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/application-requests/{{requestId}}/reject
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Nie spełnia wymagań"
}

### Publish request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/application-requests/{{requestId}}/publish

### Delete request
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/application-requests/{{requestId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Przykładowe usunięcie"
}
